sequenceDiagram
  participant MD as market_data
  participant BUS as RabbitMQ
  participant CALC as calculator
  participant ENG as trading engine
  MD->>BUS: envelope ticks generation 1
  BUS-->>CALC: ticks
  CALC->>CALC: compute flow and ATR
  CALC->>BUS: envelope advisory refs ticks
  BUS-->>ENG: advisory plus market data
  ENG->>ENG: refuse if age exceeds limit
  ENG->>BUS: envelope decision refs advisory
